error[jexpr::parser::object::orphaned-type]: Orphaned `#type` field
  ╭▸ 
1 │ {"#type": "Int"}
  │  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ `#type` cannot be used without a constructor key
  │
  ├ help: add a constructor key such as `#literal`, `#struct`, `#tuple`, `#list`, or `#dict` to this object
  ╰ note: `#type` annotates a constructor in the same object:
          - `{"#literal": 42, "#type": "Int"}`
          - `{"#struct": {"x": {"#literal": 1}}, "#type": "Point"}`
          - `{"#list": [], "#type": "List<Int>"}`
